# SSTI on registration step 1 name field. The name is evaluated as a Django template variable. The comparison name == flag matched, confirming the flag variable exists in the template context. The flag variable is truthy but renders as empty string when accessed directly.

POST /accounts/register/step1/ HTTP/1.1
